# OpenClaw workspace: ignore runtime/artifacts by default

# OpenClaw runtime & caches
runtime/
.clawhub/

# Logs/state/artifacts
**/logs/
**/state/
**/github-updates/

# Media & large binaries
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.zip
*.7z

# Temp/dev scratch
tmp_*.py
tmp_*.ps1
trending*.html

# Fusion scratch (keep structure, ignore dropped archives if any)
**/upstream/**/*.zip
**/upstream/**/*.7z

# EchoDB indexes are rebuildable; keep directory but ignore contents
memory-echoDB/indexes/**
!memory-echoDB/indexes/.gitkeep

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Curator 派生缓存 (内容寻址, 由 skills 派生可再生; 历史版本内嵌过共享 DB 活口令) -> 不入 git
hermes-vps/curator-backups/
